# Packages pacstrapped onto the USB rootfs. This is the script-based
# install set from omarchy-mac/install/omarchy-base.packages, plus USB
# extras Arch `base` does not ship. build-rootfs.sh still unions the
# sibling omarchy-base.packages at image-build time so new names land
# here without a copy. Not linux-asahi, m1n1, uboot-asahi, or
# asahi-scripts — those hooks mount the host ESP. Local omarchy-*.pkg.tar
# files are added in build-rootfs.sh via OMARCHY_LOCAL_PACKAGES.
#
# Skipped from omarchy-base.packages (see packages-aarch64-skip for the
# rest): gpu-screen-recorder (Apple GPUs; wf-recorder below); obs-studio,
# dotnet-runtime, pinta, obsidian (omarchy-aarch64-unavailable.packages).
# Remaps in build-rootfs.sh: nvim → neovim, qemu-user-static-binfmt →
# qemu-user-binfmt, hyprland-preview-share-picker →
# hyprland-preview-share-picker-git. Unresolved names fail the build.

